/*
 * Implements semantic validation for array list comprehensions.
 *
 * This module handles:
 *   - rejecting comprehensions over arrays of void elements,
 *   - converting arrays into slice aliases for iteration,
 *   - delegating comprehension validation to SliceListComprValidation,
 *   - propagating aliasing and copy-mode semantics.
 *
 * Array list comprehensions behave identically to slice list comprehensions
 * once the array has been converted into a slice alias.

 *
 * <hr>
 * 
 * @Package: ymirc        
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::compose::slicefor::array
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/compose/slicefor/array.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created (YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-05-15
 * @Copyright (C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
